### Stack and structure

- **React 19**, **Vite**, **Tailwind v3** (layout utilities; global look/feel in [`style.css`](style.css)).
- **Routing:** hash-based (`#dsa`, `#sysdes`, `#games/<slug>`, `#about`, etc.) — [`src/App.jsx`](src/App.jsx).
- **Data:** static JSON under [`public/data/`](public/data/); curriculum markdown/images under `public/content/` where applicable.
- **System Design UI:** reuse [`SystemDesignSection.jsx`](src/components/SystemDesignSection.jsx) patterns — `hi-sd-page`, `hi-sd-eyebrow`, `hi-sd-chapter`, article cards — for similar long-form or nav-heavy sections.

### UI and UX (site-specific)

- **Design philosophy:** simplicity, edge-to-edge readability, calm typography; avoid visual noise (see README).
- **Themes:** **Default** and **Midnight** only — tokens in [`style.css`](style.css), switcher in [`Header.jsx`](src/components/Header.jsx), persistence in [`App.jsx`](src/App.jsx). Theme menu: opaque `.theme-switcher-menu` (no translucent bleed-through over trust bar).
- **Copy:** English only — [`src/lib/i18n.js`](src/lib/i18n.js), `t()` with no locale argument. No language toggle without explicit product decision.
- **Mobile:** semantic breakpoints (`sm:`, `lg:`), touch-friendly targets (~44px where it matters).
- **Accessibility:** preserve `:focus-visible` from [`style.css`](style.css); keep keyboard affordances.

### Monetization and premium code

- **Monetization paused** unless explicitly re-enabling: search `MONETIZATION_PAUSED` in [`Header.jsx`](src/components/Header.jsx), [`App.jsx`](src/App.jsx), [`DSASection.jsx`](src/components/DSASection.jsx). Do not half-restore paywalls without [`roadmap.md`](roadmap.md).

### Verification (dsapatterns)

```bash
npm test
npm run build    # includes Equalize dist verification when games assets change
npm run test:e2e
```

- Structural/SEO/data: `tests/*.test.mjs`.
- Smoke: [`e2e/smoke.spec.mjs`](e2e/smoke.spec.mjs) — new hash pages need **stable copy** in the `pages` list.

### Deployment (Cloudflare Workers + Git)

Production for **dsapatterns.io** is driven from this repo via **Cloudflare** (Workers static assets), not only Vercel.

- **Git integration:** Cloudflare dashboard links the Worker to **GitHub**; pushes to **`main`** trigger build. Treat **`main`** as source of truth; mirror **`master`** when workflow still references it (see § Git & deploy).
- **Build + deploy:** `npm run build` then `npx wrangler versions upload`. [`wrangler.jsonc`](wrangler.jsonc): `assets.directory` = `./dist`, `not_found_handling` = `single-page-application`. **Do not** upload without successful Vite build — `dist/` must include `public/` (e.g. `public/games/**`).
- **Worker name:** `"name"` in `wrangler.jsonc` must match Cloudflare Worker name.
- **Stale live site:** Hashed `/assets/*` cache-bust each build; **`index.html`** may lag. After successful deploy: purge CDN (`/` and `/assets/*`, or purge all), hard-refresh/incognito; confirm deploy logs succeeded.
- **Vercel-only config:** [`vercel.json`](vercel.json) rewrites apply on **Vercel**, not Cloudflare Worker. Nested game SPAs (`/games/<slug>/*`) may need extra routing on Cloudflare — `games-building.mdc` §12 *Cloudflare vs Vercel*.
- **Sanity check:** `npm run build && npx wrangler versions upload --dry-run`.

